.DS_Store

# Secrets for the password-gated case studies.
#
# Everything committed here is published by GitHub Pages — including anything
# under work/_archive/, which is unlinked but still served at its URL. So the
# gate passwords and the unencrypted case study copy must never be committed,
# or the encryption is pointless. Only the ciphertext (.blob.txt, and the
# data-enc attribute in the page) is safe to ship.
work/_archive/_tools/PASSWORDS.md
work/_archive/_tools/*.fragment.html
